## ✅ Quick Command Cheat-Sheet

```bash
# Local network discovery
sudo nmap -PR -sn 10.200.6.0/24        # ARP scan

# ICMP-based discovery
sudo nmap -PE -sn 10.200.6.0/24        # Echo scan (ping)
sudo nmap -PP -sn 10.200.6.0/24        # Timestamp scan
sudo nmap -PM -sn 10.200.6.0/24        # Address Mask scan

# TCP-based discovery
sudo nmap -PS22,80,443 -sn 10.200.6.0/30   # SYN Ping scan
sudo nmap -PA22,80,443 -sn 10.200.6.0/30   # ACK Ping scan

# UDP-based discovery
sudo nmap -PU53,161,162 -sn 10.200.6.0/30  # UDP Ping scan

# Reading targets from a file
nmap -iL targets.txt

# Listing targets without scanning (dry run)
nmap -sL targetipaddress
```

